<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela M-0 rises 6.24 pct in week to Sept 27.</title>
<headline>Venezuela M-0 rises 6.24 pct in week to Sept 27.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's monetary base rose 6.24 percent, or 61 billion bolivars, to 1.051 trillion bolivars in the week to September 27, the central bank said.</p>
<p>At the beginning of 1996, base money stood at 873 billion bolivars.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 834405</p>
</text>
